  "title": {
   "en": "I Said I’d Do Science Popularization, But All My Fans Are Witches?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "I Said I'd Make Science Content... So Why Are All My Fans Witches?! | I Wanted to Do Science Outreach | but All My Fans Turned Out to Be Witches? | Shuō Hǎo Zuò Kēpǔ | Fěnsī Què Quán Shì Mónǚ? | Toàn Bộ Fan Của Ta Đều Là Ma Nữ | You Promised to Popularize Science | But All Your Fans Are Witches? | 说好做科普，粉丝却全是魔女？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Shep, who wanted to be a popular science UP host, traveled to another world – this is a world where only women have magic power, and magic power is productivity, magic power is power! Shep, who started out with a broken heart, hooked up with the weak and poor lord “Witch of Disaster” Reina. Unexpectedly, he turned his life around and started popular science and production construction in another world? A double harvest of career and love? !"
  },
